From c17435a61f2fa05eacb04f6c4e566012c08f51aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: localhost-copilot <318096335+localhost-copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:53:38 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] media: t7: stream through a synchronized private DMA ring

Rotate three cached private slots at write completion, gate requests before address handoff, and synchronize CPU/device access around each V4L2 copy. Pause on ring exhaustion and stop at a completion boundary; retain private DMA memory if idle cannot be proved.

Validated 5400 moving 1080p RGB24 frames at 60 fps, repeated streaming and module cycles, CMA/clock recovery, and deterministic IRQ/copy/stop schedules.
